  "bottomContent": "<div id=\"seo-intro\" style=\"padding:8px 0 0;\">\n    <h1 style=\"font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(26px,6vw,46px);letter-spacing:3px;line-height:1.1;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text;margin:16px 0 10px;\">Sketch and Guess Online</h1>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;\"><strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">Sketch and Guess</strong> is a drawing chain game where words pass through a series of drawings and guesses — getting hilariously distorted along the way. Free, for 3-10 players, on any device.</p>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;\">Draw a word, guess a drawing — and watch how your original phrase transforms beyond recognition over several rounds. <strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">No points, no competition</strong> — pure fun and laughs for everyone.</p>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px;\">Perfect as a <strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">remote team ice breaker</strong> — no language barrier since everyone draws. Great for parties, team events and as a warm-up before workshops. Bad drawings make it even funnier!</p>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);\">🎨 3-10 players</span><span style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);\">👶 Ages 8+</span><span style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);\">🆓 Free to play</span><span style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);\">📱 Mobile friendly</span><span style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);\">🎉 No points</span></div>\n  </div>\n<script>\n  (function() {\n    // SEO intro sits below the game — no injection needed, stays in natural position\n    var intro = document.getElementById('seo-intro');\n    if (intro) intro.style.display = 'block';\n  })();\n</script>\n<div style=\"max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 16px 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin-top:16px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--accent2);margin-bottom:12px;\">How to Play Sketch and Guess?</h2>\n  <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px;\">Each player writes a secret word. Words rotate around the group — the next person draws it, the next guesses what it shows, the next draws their guess and so on. At the end everyone sees the full chain of how their word evolved. The worse the drawing, the funnier the result!</p>\n  <h2 style=\"font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--accent2);margin-bottom:12px;\">Who Is This Game For?</h2>\n  <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px;\">Sketch and Guess is perfect for groups who want fun without competition. Great for parties, team building, video calls and as a warm-up activity before workshops or meetings.</p>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);\">\n    <a href=\"/szkicuj-i-zgaduj\" style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;\">🇵🇱 Szkicuj i Zgaduj</a><a href=\"/zeichnen-und-raten\" style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;\">🇩🇪 Zeichnen & Raten</a><a href=\"/skissa-och-gissa\" style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;\">🇸🇪 Skissa & Gissa</a><a href=\"/how-to-play/sketch-and-guess\" style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;\">📖 Game Rules</a><a href=\"/games\" style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;\">🎮 All Games</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script src=\"/socket.io/socket.io.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"/js/shared.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"/js/drawing-client.js\"></script>\n<script>\n// Override setUiLang on SEO pages — navigate to language-specific URL\n// instead of translating in place (keeps URL consistent with language)\nwindow._seoLangUrls = {'pl':'/szkicuj-i-zgaduj', 'en':'/sketch-and-guess', 'de':'/zeichnen-und-raten', 'sv':'/skissa-och-gissa'};\n(function() {{\n  var _origSetUiLang = null;\n  function _seoSetUiLang(code) {{\n    var url = window._seoLangUrls[code];\n    if (url) {{\n      window.location.href = url;\n    }} else if (_origSetUiLang) {{\n      _origSetUiLang(code);\n    }}\n  }}\n  // Wait for game client to define setUiLang, then override it\n  var _attempts = 0;\n  function _tryOverride() {{\n    if (typeof setUiLang === 'function' && setUiLang !== _seoSetUiLang) {{\n      _origSetUiLang = setUiLang;\n      setUiLang = _seoSetUiLang;\n      window.setUiLang = _seoSetUiLang;\n      // Rebuild lang bar so buttons use new setUiLang\n      if (typeof buildLangBar === 'function') buildLangBar();\n    }} else if (_attempts++ < 20) {{\n      setTimeout(_tryOverride, 100);\n    }}\n  }}\n  _tryOverride();\n}})();\n</script>"
